{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把矩阵按行首尾相接看成长度为 m × n 的有序数组，在虚拟下标区间上进行二分搜索。下标 k 对应矩阵位置 [⌊k / n⌋][k % n]，因此无需真的展开或复制矩阵。动画依次演示 target = 3 搜索成功，以及 target = 13 区间收缩后搜索失败，时间复杂度为 O(log(m × n))，空间复杂度为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>搜索二维矩阵可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.status-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;align-items:center}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.badge strong,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.badge.accent{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.explain{margin-top:8px;min-height:36px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.section-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:4px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,opacity .35s}\n.cell .value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.cell .meta{margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}\n.cell.range{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.mid,.cell.found{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.mid .value,.cell.found .value{color:#fff}\n.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.bounds{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.bound{flex:1 1 100px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.bound span{display:block;color:#8d8d8d}\n.bound strong{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}\n.formula{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}\n.formula code{color:#d4d4d4;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.swatch{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:inline-block;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.swatch.range{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.swatch.mid{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-inner{height:100%;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>二维矩阵当有序数组二分</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">行尾小于下一行行首，展开后仍有序。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status-row\">\n<div class=\"badge\">示例 <strong id=\"exampleNo\">1</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge accent\">target = <strong id=\"target\">3</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\" id=\"result\">搜索中</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></p>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-inner\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">虚拟下标映射</div>\n<div class=\"matrix\" id=\"matrix\"></div>\n<div class=\"bounds\">\n<div class=\"bound\"><span>left</span><strong id=\"left\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"bound\"><span>mid</span><strong id=\"mid\">5</strong></div>\n<div class=\"bound\"><span>right</span><strong id=\"right\">11</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><code>行 = ⌊mid / n⌋，列 = mid % n</code><br><code id=\"mapping\">mid = 5 → matrix[1][1] = 11</code></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><span class=\"swatch range\"></span>候选</span><span><span class=\"swatch mid\"></span>中点</span><span>排除变暗</span></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const values = [1, 3, 5, 7, 10, 11, 16, 20, 23, 30, 34, 60];\n  const cols = 4;\n  const matrix = document.getElementById('matrix');\n  values.forEach((value, index) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"meta\">' + index + '·[' + Math.floor(index / cols) + ',' + (index % cols) + ']</div>';\n    matrix.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  const scenes = [\n    { ex: 1, target: 3, left: 0, right: 11, mid: 5, text: '先检查中点：matrix[1][1] = 11。因为 11 大于 3，答案只可能在左半区。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 1, target: 3, left: 0, right: 4, mid: 2, text: '新区间是 [0, 4]，中点值为 5。因为 5 仍大于 3，继续缩小右边界。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 1, target: 3, left: 0, right: 1, mid: 0, text: '中点值为 1，小于 3，因此排除下标 0，并把左边界推进到 1。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 1, target: 3, left: 1, right: 1, mid: 1, text: '中点值恰好等于 target，搜索成功，返回 true。', result: '找到：true', found: true },\n    { ex: 2, target: 13, left: 0, right: 11, mid: 5, text: '重新搜索 target = 13。中点值 11 小于 13，排除中点及其左侧。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 2, target: 13, left: 6, right: 11, mid: 8, text: '中点值为 23，大于 13，答案若存在只能位于下标 6 到 7。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 2, target: 13, left: 6, right: 7, mid: 6, text: '中点值为 16，大于 13，右边界左移到 5。', result: '正在搜索' },\n    { ex: 2, target: 13, left: 6, right: 5, mid: -1, text: '此时 left > right，候选区间为空，说明矩阵中不存在 13，返回 false。', result: '未找到：false', empty: true }\n  ];\n\n  let current = 0;\n  function render(scene) {\n    document.getElementById('exampleNo').textContent = scene.ex;\n    document.getElementById('target').textContent = scene.target;\n    document.getElementById('left').textContent = scene.left;\n    document.getElementById('right').textContent = scene.right;\n    document.getElementById('mid').textContent = scene.empty ? '—' : scene.mid;\n    document.getElementById('explain').textContent = scene.text;\n    document.getElementById('result').textContent = scene.result;\n    document.getElementById('progress').style.width = ((current + 1) / scenes.length * 100) + '%';\n\n    const mapping = document.getElementById('mapping');\n    if (scene.empty) {\n      mapping.textContent = 'left = 6，right = 5 → 搜索区间为空';\n    } else {\n      const row = Math.floor(scene.mid / cols);\n      const col = scene.mid % cols;\n      mapping.textContent = 'mid = ' + scene.mid + ' → matrix[' + row + '][' + col + '] = ' + values[scene.mid];\n    }\n\n    [...matrix.children].forEach((cell, index) => {\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      if (scene.empty || index < scene.left || index > scene.right) cell.classList.add('discarded');\n      else cell.classList.add('range');\n      if (!scene.empty && index === scene.mid) cell.classList.add(scene.found ? 'found' : 'mid');\n    });\n  }\n\n  render(scenes[current]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % scenes.length;\n    render(scenes[current]);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(log(mn))",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "m、n 是矩阵行数、列数. 通过 k/n 和 k%n 映射虚拟下标, 在 mn 个有序元素中二分; 不真正展开或复制矩阵."
}
